  "decision_conditions": [
    "The documents/information submitted, in the absence of any conflicting evidence, is satisfactory to prove, on the balance of probabilities, that the dwellinghouse at 113a Byron Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7TB, has been in use as two self-contained residential units for a continuous period of at least 4 years prior to the date of this application. The existing development is therefore considered to be lawful.",
    "The\nuse of the dwellinghouse at 113a Byron Road, Wealdstone, Harrow, HA3 7TB, as two\nself-contained residential units, is immune from enforcement action and is therefore\nlawful under S.171B of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended)."
  ],
